// The shared realtime-wire vectors. Generated by
// web/scripts/gen-realtime-wire-vectors.mjs and read — never copied — by the
// Web, Swift and Android suites; this is the Go reader.
//
// The path is relative to this package directory. A missing or unreadable file
// is a FAILURE, never a skip: a vector suite that silently passes without its
// vectors is the gate that cannot fail.
const wireVectorsPath = "../../../apps/RelayiumKit/Tests/Fixtures/realtime-wire-vectors.json"

// ---- the fixture's shape ------------------------------------------------------
//
// Every struct below mirrors the fixture exactly. A field tagged
// `wire:"optional"` may be absent; every other field must be present with this
// exact, case-sensitive key. A pointer field may be JSON null; no other field
// may. json.RawMessage fields are peer-authored signals and are fed, as their
// raw bytes, to the package's untrusted parsers.

